## Scope of the MIT license

The MIT license above covers the shadercn runtime (`renderer.ts`), orb presets
(`meta.ts`), the Angular wrappers, docs site, TypeGPU esbuild intercept,
microphone `[listen]` drive, and reduced-motion handling.

## Shader programs (`src/components/orbs/*/gpu.ts`) are NOT MIT

Every `gpu.ts` file is based on original shader work by XorDev
(https://x.com/XorDev), ported with the author's permission. Those files carry
their own terms in the header notice:

    Non-commercial use only, with attribution to XorDev; keep this notice with
    the file.

If you copy an orb into your project you take that restriction with it. For
commercial use of the shader programs, obtain permission from XorDev.
